SinoFlow Business Chinese Essential Phrases List:
1. 合作愉快 (hézuò yúkuài) - Happy to cooperate with you
2. 请多指教 (qǐng duō zhǐjiào) - Please give me your guidance
3. 贵公司 (guì gōngsī) - Your esteemed company
4. 签合同 (qiān hétóng) - Sign a contract
5. 商务会议 (shāngwù huìyì) - Business meeting
6. 谈判 (tánpàn) - Negotiation
7. 合作意向书 (hézuò yìxiàngshū) - Letter of intent for cooperation
